The '''Well-Being level''',<ref name="Encyclopedia">{{EncyclopediaCite|Scarif and Other Planets in the Outer Rim}}</ref> also referred to as '''Level 10'''<ref name="SWCL" /> and written as the '''Tenth Level''',<ref name="Episode III summary">{{SW|url=films/star-wars-episode-3-revenge-of-the-sith-story-gallery|text=''Star Wars: Revenge of the Sith'' Story Gallery}}</ref> was a location in [[Pau City]] on the [[planet]] [[Utapau]].<ref name="SWCL" /> Towards the [[Mission to Mustafar|end]] of the [[Clone Wars]], [[General]] [[Grievous]] and the [[Executive Separatist Council|Separatist Council]] hid on the level aboard a [[Unidentified core ship|core ship]] with an [[army]] made up of thousands of [[battle droid]]s.<ref name="Episode III" />

